      "parameters": {
        "content": "## YouTube Comment Miner v1 — CH Brands India\n\n**Owner:** Tron (Noel Gomes)  \n**Target ship:** Thu 13 Nov 2026  \n**Scope v1:** Ensure Protein — 3 seed videos, comment mining, GPT-4o-mini classification, Google Sheets append.\n\n**Deferred to v1.1+:**\n- Pagination beyond first 100 comments per video\n- Video transcription (Apify) + GPT-4o video context layer\n- Weekly Cron (currently disabled — flip at Stage 6 Harden)\n- Supabase pgvector RAG chat layer (v2)\n\n**Sheet:** YouTube Comment Miner - Ensure Protein (ID 1JsdwN-qU6mhKwIiNQlNUxcua-OOTWS7dYPB8RA8j_fE)\n\n**Credentials to wire at Stage 3:**\n1. YouTube API (Query Auth → key param, API key from label-lens GCP project)\n2. OpenAI (existing paid account)\n3. Google Sheets OAuth (existing credential)",
